add(P('{{c:inset}}In the Cu-free in vitro culture after 10 months{{/c}}, T-GRSP was 58.4 ± 3.1 µg g^−1^ in GC3 and 65.3 ± 3.7 µg g^−1^ in W/I, and EE-GRSP was 74.5 ± 1.9 and 88.2 ± 6.6 µg g^−1^, with no significant differences (*P* = 0.198 and 0.077; insets in Fig. 5A, B). In the in vitro assay with Cu, T-GRSP (20–24 µg g^−1^) and EE-GRSP (4–6 µg g^−1^ as means) did not differ with inoculation (*P* = 0.265 and 0.990) or Cu (*P* = 0.438 and 0.465), although T-GRSP was lower in GC3 than in W/I in Cu1 (*P* = 0.010; Fig. 5C, D).'));
